    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "낭인의 길",
        "summary": "야스오의 치명타 확률이 증가합니다. 또한, 야스오는 이동할 때마다 보호막이 충전되며, 챔피언이나 몬스터로부터 피해를 입으면 보호막이 발동됩니다.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">결의:</span> 이동 시 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">기류</span>가 발생하여 야스오의 자원이 채워지며, 빠르게 움직일수록 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">기류</span>가 더 빠르게 오릅니다. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">기류</span>가 가득 차면 챔피언이나 몬스터에게서 피해를 입을 경우 잠시 <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(125 ~ 600)의 피해를 흡수하는 보호막</span>이 생성됩니다.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">의지:</span> 야스오의 치명타 확률이 100% 증가하지만, 치명타 피해량이 (100%)까지 감소합니다. 100%를 초과하는 치명타 확률 1%당 <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">의 추가 공격력</span>을 얻습니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Way of the Wanderer",
        "summary": "Yasuo's Critical Strike Chance is increased. Additionally, Yasuo builds toward a shield whenever he is moving. The shield triggers when he takes damage from a champion or monster.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Resolve:</span> Moving grants <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Flow</span>, which is tracked on Yasuo's resource bar. Moving faster grants more <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Flow</span>. At maximum <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Flow</span>, damage from a champion or monster briefly grants <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(125 ~ 600) Shield</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Intent:</span> Yasuo's Critical Strike Chance is increased by 100% but his Critical Strike Damage is reduced to (100%). Gain <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> Bonus Attack Damage</span> for every 1% Critical Strike Chance above 100%."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "浪客之道",
        "summary": "亚索的暴击几率提升。此外，亚索在移动时会为一层护盾攒能。护盾会在他受到来自英雄或野怪的伤害时触发。",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">百折不屈：</span>亚索在移动的同时会积攒<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">剑意</span>——移动得越快，<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">剑意</span>的获取就越多。当<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">剑意</span>槽被充满时，在受到来自英雄或野怪的伤害的同时，亚索暂时获得<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(125 ~ 600)护盾值</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">向死而生：</span>亚索的暴击几率提升100%但他的暴击伤害降低至(100%)。100%以上的暴击几率，会每1%转化为<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">额外攻击力</span>。"
      }
    }
  }
}